{"id":"privychka","lemma":"привычка","pos":"noun","rank":3057,"glosses":["habit, custom"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f8/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%B2%D1%8B%D1%87%D0%BA%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%B2%D1%8B%D1%87%D0%BA%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"привычки","plural":"привычки"},"examples":[{"text":"Это плохая привычка.","en":"It's a bad habit.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"bad","l":"плохой"},null]},{"text":"Это дело привычки.","en":"It's a matter of habit.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"affair"},null]},{"text":"От какой привычки ты хочешь избавиться?","en":"What's a habit you want to break?","words":[{"g":"from"},{"g":"what, what one"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to get rid of"}]},{"text":"У него привычка плевать на землю.","en":"He has the habit of spitting on the ground.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"he, it","l":"он"},null,{"g":"to spit"},{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Старые привычки трудно оставить.","en":"Old habits are hard to break.","words":[{"g":"old","l":"старый"},null,{"g":"it is difficult, hard"},{"g":"to leave"}]}]}